ws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104020Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=e1c9754a0c4dd8ba1bb2f16137467e7ebfa39bf8a43b4bb1733c7630cb5cbdbd", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/image/upgrade_access.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104020Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=e1c9754a0c4dd8ba1bb2f16137467e7ebfa39bf8a43b4bb1733c7630cb5cbdbd", "license_name": "CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/image/upgrade_access.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104020Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=e1c9754a0c4dd8ba1bb2f16137467e7ebfa39bf8a43b4bb1733c7630cb5cbdbd"}, "scientific_name": ["Rheum hybridum"], "species_epithet": "hybridum"}', '2026-06-07 10:40:20.605028+00', 'Leaves contain oxalic acid and anthraquinones; ingestion causes severe digestive upset, tremors, and potential kidney damage. Stems are edible when cooked but raw consumption may cause mouth and throat irritation.', 'Average', '{full_sun,part_shade}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Check soil moisture 5–8 cm deep; water when soil begins to dry at this depth. Rhubarb prefers consistently moist but not waterlogged soil during the growing season.', NULL, NULL, 'Beginner', 'A cold-hardy herbaceous perennial with large, deeply lobed leaves and stout reddish or green edible petioles. Valued for culinary use and architectural foliage in temperate gardens.', 'Outdoor', false, true, 'Leaves are toxic due to high oxalic acid content; ingestion causes severe gastroenteritis, kidney damage, and hypocalcemia. Stems are edible and safe when cooked.', true, 'Late Spring – Early Summer', true, 'Late Spring – Early Summer', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich,Moisture-retaining}', 'Central Asia', 120, 90, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/74418856/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/74418856/medium.jpg', true, 480750, 480750, 'hybrid');
