er', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Sandy,Poor}', 'North America (prairies, open woodlands, and disturbed areas)', 90, 60, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4647603/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4647603/medium.jpg', true, 125379, 125379, 'species');
