sted. May cause gastrointestinal irritation and dermatitis on skin contact in sensitive individuals.', false, NULL, true, 'Spring – Summer', 'Moderate', 'High', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich}', 'Vanuatu (South Pacific)', 150, 120, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/62690926/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/62690926/medium.jpeg', true, 277579, 277579, 'species');
