=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104021Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=a06ae0dbee7e45598f5c5965ff13a5f91b58c882abf0a98a528c541992eee8ef", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/image/upgrade_access.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104021Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=a06ae0dbee7e45598f5c5965ff13a5f91b58c882abf0a98a528c541992eee8ef", "license_name": "CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/image/upgrade_access.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T104021Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=a06ae0dbee7e45598f5c5965ff13a5f91b58c882abf0a98a528c541992eee8ef"}, "scientific_name": ["Anthurium andraeanum (incl. hybrid cvs.)"], "species_epithet": "andraeanum"}', '2026-06-07 10:40:21.50393+00', 'Contains calcium oxalate crystals. Ingestion causes oral irritation, drooling, difficulty swallowing, and vomiting in cats and dogs.', 'Frequent', '{filtered_indirect}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Allow top 2–3 cm of soil to dry between waterings. Never allow the root ball to dry completely, as this aroid prefers consistently moist (not soggy) conditions.', 80, 95, 'Intermediate', 'A striking tropical aroid with waxy, heart-shaped spathes (flowers) in red, pink, white, or coral, accented by a yellow spadix. Prized for its long-lasting blooms and glossy foliage, it is a popular indoor ornamental and effective air purifier.', 'Indoor', true, true, 'Calcium oxalate crystals cause oral and throat irritation if chewed or ingested. Sap may irritate skin and eyes.', true, 'Summer – Autumn', true, 'Spring – Autumn (year-round indoors under optimal conditions)', 'Moderate', 'Medium', '{Well-draining,Peaty,Rich}', 'Colombia', 90, 60, true, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/336703418/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/336703418/medium.jpeg', true, 69235, 69235, 'species');
