bb716c", "medium_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/1027_asparagus_officinalis_jersey_knight/medium/green-asparagus-asparagus-green-vegetables-eat-healthy.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260604%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260604T142336Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=1da4f0d387eff48202cb2a29292f50046760063442c9e260a00fe23ca9092d18", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/1027_asparagus_officinalis_jersey_knight/regular/green-asparagus-asparagus-green-vegetables-eat-healthy.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260604%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260604T142336Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=2be1faf2488c6ad2c6ed2dae9fa06813ac2ef7bb03364a1540f99de6fcfca3aa", "license_name": "CC0 1.0 Universal (CC0 1.0) Public Domain Dedication", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/1027_asparagus_officinalis_jersey_knight/og/green-asparagus-asparagus-green-vegetables-eat-healthy.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260604%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260604T142336Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=ab0ca218ff6ae5a934635002efd797dbb4bf0d7ecd49b3cff2c1f501fe0956d9"}, "scientific_name": ["Asparagus officinalis ''Jersey Knight''"], "species_epithet": "officinalis"}', '2026-06-04 14:23:36.691437+00', NULL, 'Average', '{full_sun}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Water deeply to maintain consistently moist soil during growing season; allow soil to dry slightly between waterings in dormancy.', NULL, NULL, 'Intermediate', 'A productive perennial