n – Winter', 'Moderate', 'High', '{Well-draining,Rich,Moisture-retaining}', 'Tropical Americas (Brazil and Mexico)', 90, 60, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/268879537/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/268879537/medium.jpg', true, 322316, 322316, 'species');
