w-maintenance bulb ideal for naturalized planting schemes.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, 'Early Spring', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Sandy,Loamy}', 'Central and Southern Europe (Alps, Balkans, Carpathians)', 15, 8, false, 'https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/282771894/square.jpeg', 'https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/282771894/medium.jpeg', true, 1371920, NULL, 'complex');
