ream flowers in late spring, followed by raspberry-like red fruit in autumn. Prized for its multi-season interest and architectural silhouette.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, true, 'Autumn', true, 'Late Spring', 'Moderate', 'Medium', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich}', 'East Asia (China, Japan, Korea)', 400, 350, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/69066485/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/69066485/medium.jpg', true, 128614, 128614, 'species');
