ers in spring. Valued for brightening shaded borders with year-round foliage interest.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, false, NULL, true, 'Spring', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Moisture-retaining}', 'Caucasus and Siberia', 45, 60, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/36017337/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/36017337/medium.jpg', true, 55852, 55852, 'species');
