?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T192747Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=4ccefd7a39cd1287c1ddd55661bfe7e7b17e9929fe89c90ed2fa63e5fdcd1174", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/540_adenium_obesum/regular/9244335137_6d662ed77c_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T192747Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=3c953cb3b2b335d7b71d2c3aceffd390f79c7b90935797e1b0f3dbd60b269a8b", "license_name": "Attribution-ShareAlike License", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/540_adenium_obesum/og/9244335137_6d662ed77c_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T192747Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=1de7627cf5b2b2d7c74cd1c8de958fa3fe430b4be7081aa64299f6e9fe6d1be4"}, "scientific_name": ["Adenium obesum"], "species_epithet": "obesum"}', '2026-05-30 19:27:48.796969+00', 'All parts are toxic if ingested. Contains cardiac glycosides that can cause severe gastrointestinal upset, irregular heartbeat, and potentially fatal arrhythmias in dogs, cats, and other animals.', 'Minimum', '{full_sun}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Allow soil to dry completely between waterings. Check soil at 5 cm depth; water only when bone-dry.', 30, 50, 'Intermediate', 'A striking succulent shrub with a swollen, caudiciform trunk and glossy deep-green foliage bearing showy pink, red, or bi-coloured trumpet flowers. Highly ornamental and drought-tolerant, ideal for bright indoor displays or hot, arid outdoor gardens.', 'Both', true, true, 'All plant parts are poisonous. Ingestion causes severe gastrointestinal pain, irregular heartbeat, and potentially life-threatening cardiac effects. Sap may cause skin and eye irritation.', true, 'Summer – Autumn', true, 'Late Spring – Summer', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Sandy}', 'Tropical and subtropical Africa, Arabian Peninsula, and Madagascar', 150, 100, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/369479493/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/369479493/medium.jpeg', true, 124839, 124839, 'species');
