eguine/medium/24449059743_2aee995991_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T141113Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=9b102f9ae545c44ecc03bbc0b489e083fa01b2b19385d92a76e94b33a7f5b209", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/2468_dieffenbachia_seguine/regular/24449059743_2aee995991_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T141113Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=8da58baa9e9adfc9b25e9645aa7f89a7429dbc63e1ecfefc34ff454e76ab6584", "license_name": "Attribution License", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/2468_dieffenbachia_seguine/og/24449059743_2aee995991_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260607%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260607T141113Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=6b63855a7ec2a4ce87549387a94a8a581af34fcb172bff78991c5ef8f150ea05"}, "scientific_name": ["Dieffenbachia seguine"], "species_epithet": "seguine"}', '2026-06-03 14:46:49.443529+00', 'All parts contain calcium oxalate crystals causing oral irritation, drooling, difficulty swallowing, and potential airway obstruction in pets. Leaves are most toxic.', 'Average', '{filtered_indirect,part_shade}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Allow top 2–3 cm of soil to dry between waterings. Do not allow the root ball to dry completely.', 50, 70, 'Beginner', 'A tropical aroid with large, variegated oval leaves featuring cream or white markings on deep green foliage. Fast-growing and tolerant of low light, it is popular as a houseplant and valued for its striking foliage and air-purifying qualities.', 'Indoor', true, true, 'Sap and tissues contain calcium oxalate crystals causing immediate burning sensation and swelling of lips, mouth, and throat if ingested or chewed. Can cause difficulty speaking (hence ''dumb cane'') and temporary loss of voice. Sap may irritate skin upon contact.', false, NULL, true, 'Spring – Summer', 'Fast', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich}', 'Tropical South America', 150, 60, true, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/325214430/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/325214430/medium.jpg', true, 206266, 206266, 'species');
