ustralia (New South Wales)', 600, 300, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/68014849/square.jpg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/68014849/medium.jpg', true, 162748, 162748, 'species');
