m/40079111613_2953016b89_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260602%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260602T014030Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=1bdc1da0ad7d8c0f3a747a8ca50784563716350d3325273bafb8a0788f477a83", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/2486_digitalis_obscura/regular/40079111613_2953016b89_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260602%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260602T014030Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=d89ac65dcc444ba7ec0ee52bac4d476ab1043c2f72194ae65646d9dad98f8190", "license_name": "Attribution-ShareAlike License", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/2486_digitalis_obscura/og/40079111613_2953016b89_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260602%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260602T014030Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=b2a99e9e5f7217ffc0184520b5dee5f5063ad1b911600cd640310da1cd5cbf4e"}, "scientific_name": ["Digitalis obscura"], "species_epithet": "obscura"}', '2026-06-02 01:40:30.814436+00', 'All parts contain cardiac glycosides (cardenolides). Ingestion causes severe gastrointestinal distress, arrhythmias, and potentially fatal cardiac toxicity in dogs, cats, and livestock.', 'Average', '{full_sun,part_shade}', 'Biennial', NULL, 'Water when top 2–3 cm of soil becomes dry. Avoid waterlogging; ensure good drainage. Reduce watering in winter dormancy.', NULL, NULL, 'Intermediate', 'A Mediterranean native biennial or short-lived perennial foxglove with narrow, willow-like leaves and tubular yellow or rust-red flowers in summer. Valued for cottage gardens and naturalistic plantings for its elegant spires and ability to self-seed in well-drained soils.', 'Outdoor', false, true, 'All parts contain cardiac glycosides. Ingestion causes severe nausea, vomiting, abdominal pain, and life-threatening cardiac arrhythmias. Skin contact may cause dermatitis in sensitive individuals.', true, 'Late Summer – Autumn', true, 'Summer', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Sandy,Loamy}', 'Southern Spain and Portugal (Iberian Peninsula)', 90, 30, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/287795085/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/287795085/medium.jpeg', true, 358069, 358069, 'species');
