larly in winter when bare branches are most visible.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, true, 'Late Summer – Autumn', true, 'Spring', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Sandy,Loamy}', 'Northern Europe', 600, 400, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/36257611/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/36257611/medium.jpeg', true, 83992, 83992, 'species');
