 delicate texture and architectural form in woodland gardens and containers.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, true, 'Autumn', true, 'Spring', 'Slow', 'Medium', '{}', 'Japan (endemic to specific regions of Honshu)', 600, 400, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/82247849/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/82247849/medium.jpeg', true, 553005, 553005, 'species');
