ushed seeds or large quantities of leaves poses cyanide toxicity risk. Ripe fruit flesh is safe to eat; do not consume seeds.', true, 'Summer', true, 'Spring', 'Moderate', 'Low', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich}', 'Europe and Western Asia', 2500, 1500, false, 'https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/66778868/square.jpeg', 'https://static.inaturalist.org/photos/66778868/medium.jpeg', true, 61964, 61964, 'species');
