?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T185048Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=fe14d461ee4a4f742b478e7ac97f5cad6a7dce3860263f17edaabf0f9e6cadfc", "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/", "regular_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/17_acer_japonicum/regular/7175475239_52543c51b3_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T185048Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=768f4a2084a32398d4e88157fc7d3a4775681435b6bf1253ce7a8acfc07756d6", "license_name": "Attribution License", "original_url": "https://s3.us-central-1.wasabisys.com/perenual/species_image/17_acer_japonicum/og/7175475239_52543c51b3_b.jpg?X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&X-Amz-Credential=0MPGHU7CIPXNPMVWMXUW%2F20260530%2Fus-central-1%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&X-Amz-Date=20260530T185048Z&X-Amz-SignedHeaders=host&X-Amz-Expires=86400&X-Amz-Signature=833a19d74d2b45cd570237cb1b9265e93dfcaef70b707f00576a62012d14a9e9"}, "scientific_name": ["Acer japonicum"], "species_epithet": "japonicum"}', '2026-05-30 18:50:49.00676+00', NULL, 'Average', '{part_shade,filtered_indirect}', 'Perennial', NULL, 'Keep soil consistently moist but not waterlogged during growing season; check soil at 5 cm depth and water when it feels dry to the touch. Reduce watering in winter dormancy.', 50, 70, 'Intermediate', 'A deciduous Japanese maple with delicate, deeply lobed palmate leaves that turn brilliant crimson and gold in autumn. Prized as an ornamental specimen tree for its graceful habit, fine foliage texture, and stunning seasonal colour.', 'Outdoor', false, false, NULL, true, 'Autumn', true, 'Spring', 'Slow', 'Medium', '{Well-draining,Loamy,Rich}', 'Japan', 600, 450, false, 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4755377/square.jpeg', 'https://inaturalist-open-data.s3.amazonaws.com/photos/4755377/medium.jpeg', true, 63510, 63510, 'species');
